        <briefdescription>
<para>Writes the report of <computeroutput>profiles</computeroutput> to <computeroutput>outputFile</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The function builds the report document from <computeroutput>profiles</computeroutput> and adds the charts of each profile table. It writes the document through <computeroutput><ref refid="structjam_1_1MarkdownWriter" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::MarkdownWriter</ref></computeroutput>, which creates the parent folder of <computeroutput>outputFile</computeroutput>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>profiles</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Tree of the profile tables that <ref refid="class_benchmark_1ac2758e9667d09cca4fa1c7d0845c7413" kindref="member">Benchmark::getProfiles()</ref> returns. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>outputFile</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>File that receives the report. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para><computeroutput>true</computeroutput> when the write succeeds, or <computeroutput>false</computeroutput> when it fails. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
